{"id":1100,"date":"2024-08-20T15:44:00","date_gmt":"2024-08-20T15:44:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/?page_id=1100"},"modified":"2025-10-05T19:46:08","modified_gmt":"2025-10-05T19:46:08","slug":"michael-sanchez","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/michael-sanchez\/","title":{"rendered":"Michael S\u00e1nchez"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1100\" class=\"elementor elementor-1100\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9c4302 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d9c4302\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fab7806 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fab7806\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-76366a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"76366a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"811\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/michael2-811x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-967\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/michael2-811x1024.png 811w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/michael2-238x300.png 238w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/michael2-768x970.png 768w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/michael2.png 869w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 811px) 100vw, 811px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b261bd2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b261bd2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45e51c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"45e51c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Teclea aqu\u00ed...\" style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;font-weight: 600;text-transform: none;font-size: 50px;text-align: justify\">Michael S\u00e1nchez,<br><\/h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Teclea aqu\u00ed...\" style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;font-weight: 600;text-transform: none;font-size: 20px;line-height: 20px\"><i>Instructor<\/i><span style=\"font-size: 32px\"><\/span><\/h4><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-efded92 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"efded92\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Michael S\u00e1nchez es analista de datos en el Observatorio Nacional de Radioastronom\u00eda (NRAO) en los Estados Unidos, donde se especializa en la reducci\u00f3n de datos radioastron\u00f3micos interferom\u00e9tricos y garantiza la calidad de productos de datos listos para la ciencia. Con ra\u00edces en Texas y de ascendencia salvadore\u00f1a, Michael obtuvo su Licenciatura y Maestr\u00eda en F\u00edsica de Texas State University, con un enfoque en astrof\u00edsica. Su experiencia incluye el an\u00e1lisis de datos fotom\u00e9tricos y espectrosc\u00f3picos infrarrojos de proto-estrellas y discos protoplanetarios utilizando Python. En su taller, \u00abDescubriendo el Poder de la Anal\u00edtica,\u00bb Michael ense\u00f1ar\u00e1 a los participantes a manejar, analizar e interpretar grandes conjuntos de datos utilizando librer\u00edas de Python como pandas, numpy, y matplotlib, preparando a los estudiantes para transformar datos complejos en informaci\u00f3n clara y procesable.<\/span><\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f3654f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8f3654f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Michael S\u00e1nchez, Instructor Michael S\u00e1nchez es analista de datos en el Observatorio Nacional de Radioastronom\u00eda (NRAO) en los Estados Unidos, donde se especializa en la reducci\u00f3n de datos radioastron\u00f3micos interferom\u00e9tricos y garantiza la calidad de productos de datos listos para la ciencia. Con ra\u00edces en Texas y de ascendencia salvadore\u00f1a, Michael obtuvo su Licenciatura y [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1100","page","type-page","status-publish"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1100","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1100"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1100\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2248,"href":"https:\/\